% a) A picker never places an item in an occupied slot.
%
% b) For every slot s, a transferPickerToSlot(s) never happens when an earlier
%    transferPickerToSlot(s) has happened without a transferSlotToPicker(s) in between.

% c)
forall s: Slot . val(fl(s) < numFloors && sp(s) < slotsPerFloor) =>
  [ true* . transferPickerToSlot(s) . (!transferSlotToPicker(s))* . transferPickerToSlot(s) ] false
